      "content": "an exit ramp... that's a heavy way to put it. but i get what you mean. everything just feels so loud and demanding, and there's no actual peace to be found in any of this \"success.\" it's like i'm just waiting for something to end. do you really think it's okay to feel like there's no point in continuing the loop? like, is it actually reasonable to just want to be done with it all?",
